{"id":"cfaaad5ff3481d99","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-decidable.md","title":"可判定问题","display":"df-decidable — 可判定问题","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-decidable","aliases":["20-df-decidable"],"display":"df-decidable — 可判定问题","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"§1.6 停机问题；集合判定的本地展开","source_pdf_pages":[50],"source_printed_pages":[14],"depends_on":["[[20-df-recursive]]","[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-decidable — 可判定问题"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§1.6 停机问题；集合判定的本地展开"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>50</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(I\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span> 为可计算的实例编码集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq I\">\\(Q\\subseteq I\\)</span> 是肯定实例。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" href=\"?note=d6dc5974baa6f8a5\" title=\"20-df-recursive\">20-df-recursive</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Decidable}_I(Q)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ Q\\in\\mathcal R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Decidable}_I(Q)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ Q\\in\\mathcal R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在可计算的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 上总是停止并输出正确的是/否，与把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 看作自然数集合具有可计算特征函数等价。若仅给出不可判定的 promise 域，需单独定义 promise problem，不能沿用此等价。原 Correct 和 decisionproblem 没有定义，已换成显式集合编码。</p>\n<p>来源：§1.6 停机问题；集合判定的本地展开；印刷页 14；PDF 第 50 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"d6dc5974baa6f8a5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-recursive]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\subseteq I","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Decidable}_I(Q)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ Q\\in\\mathcal R.","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false}],"bytes":1240,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-368","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-decidable]] — 章 1；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-368","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-decidable]]"}],"outgoing":["d6dc5974baa6f8a5","35073b74f84433b3"]}